    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE IMMIGRANTS AND EMIGRANTS ACT(CHAPTER 351)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      267.17,
      401.9,
      291.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.97,
      401.77,
      328.91
    ],
    "text": "1. This Act may be cited as the Immigrants and Emigrants(Amendment) Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      342.77,
      401.86,
      366.71
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 14 of the Immigrants and Emigrants Act(Chapter 351) is hereby amended as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      380.57,
      401.88,
      404.51
    ],
    "text": "(1)in subsection (1) thereof, by the substitution for thewords, \u201ctwo years,\u201d of the words \u201cfive years,\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      418.37,
      401.89,
      467.51
    ],
    "text": "(2)in subsection (2) thereof, by the substitution for thewords, \u201cexceeding two years but not exceeding fiveyears,\u201d of the words \u201cexceeding five years but notexceeding ten years,\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      481.37,
      401.89,
      505.31
    ],
    "text": "(3)by the insertion immediately after subsection (3)thereof, of the following subsection:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      519.17,
      401.9,
      568.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(3A) (a) Notwithstanding the time limitsspecified in subsections (1) and (2), the periodof permanent residence visa may be determinedby the Minister.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      209.85,
      582.17,
      401.87,
      618.71
    ],
    "text": "(b) For the purpose of paragraph (a),\u201cpermanent residence visa\u201d means a visa grantedunder regulations made under this Act.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      632.57,
      401.9,
      656.51
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
